   <indicator measure="2">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indicator 1</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Quality Enhancement Monitoring index scores reach at least 75% for Mongkol Borei Provincial Hospital and at least 60% for Poipet Referral Hospital 
Progress/Status: Semester 1-2024:
In semester 1-2024, the national quality enhancement monitoring index score for Mongkol Borei provincial hospital is 60.38% and Poipet referral hospital 45.29%.

Semester 2-2024:
In semester 2-2024, Mongkol Borei provincial hospital is 64.11% and Poipet referral hospital is 32.74%.  In Poi Pet hospital 7 of 11 main standard groups decreased the score comparing to previous assessment.

Semester 1-2025:
In semester 1-2025, Mongkol Borei provincial hospital is 78.43% and Poipet referral hospital is 52.64%. 
Data Source: National Quality Enhancement Monitoring Tool-2 
Actual value:</narrative>
    </description>
