Progress/Status: Project engaged a Training Specialist in Q4-2024. The training need assessment has been conducted in Q4-2024 with report finalized in Q1-2025. TOR for workforce training consulting firm (CS 05) was finalized and advertised in Q2 2025. The gender-based violence trainings will commence in 2026. 
